//Cheats/Enable Debug Mode Controller #1 debug inputs:Triangle + Circle + X + Square + Start will return you to the title screen.Select + Triangle will enable or disable progressive mode.Controller #2 debug inputs: Circle to toggle debug modes. Press this once or twice to enable sound test options in the Options menu in the main menu.Square to toggle Debug flag on or off. This unlocks everything temporarily
